## .NET build output
# Standard .NET output (Git normalizes Windows path separators to `/`).
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/

# Some .NET/EF tooling can emit literal Windows-style directory names on Unix.
# `?` matches the literal backslash character, but does not cross `/` boundaries.
**/[Bb]in?[Dd]ebug/
**/[Bb]in?[Rr]elease/
**/[Oo]bj?[Dd]ebug/
**/[Oo]bj?[Rr]elease/
**/TestResults/

## IDE
.vs/
.vscode/settings.json
*.user
*.suo

## Local environment and secrets
.env
appsettings.Development.local.json
**/pem/*private*.pem
